1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,057
Straight ahead, K is one.

2
00:00:02,057 --> 00:00:04,557
Straight backwards, it is zero.

3
00:00:04,557 --> 00:00:07,565
So only the forward envelope survives.

4
00:00:07,565 --> 00:00:14,674
In the exam, it is enough to say: secondary wavelets are effective only in the forward direction.

